event_inherited();

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"If you know that what Grace did was wrong, why didn't you do anything about it?"
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	"...[/page]I...[/page]I was...[/page][shake]...Scared.[/shake]",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Brooklyn- and Grace too, they already hate me...
[/page]If I defied them... [scale,0.75]They'd kick me out of the club...[/s]",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"And that equals what happened to Frenchie?"
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	"No! No, I just...",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"There is something you can still do."
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	"It's too late... He's already [c_grey]dead[/c].",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	@"Not about Frenchie. About Grace, McRonald and Wei.
[/page]They're going to hurt each other eventually if they keep up the fighting they did this morning."
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Even so...
[/page]I couldn't possibly help.",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"Why not?"
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"I'm a weak person, Bobby... I'd give anything to fit in...
[/page]I realized long ago, no matter how smart I am...
[/page]Nobody cares. People would rather pretend I didn't exist.
[/page]But who could blame them? The real me is weird, gloomy, just plain ugly. 
[/page]Like this... Like myself, I'll never be liked by anyone.
[/page]At least with my Anime thing... People talk to me.
[/page]Grace may call me names, Brooklyn might roll her eyes at me... But they don't ignore me!
[/page]If only for a second, my voice was heard.
[/page]But now, I see clearly... my face, that way of life, was on borrowed time all along.
[/page]It couldn't change a thing. Frenchie's death, the AI photos, [slant]anything[/slant].
[/page]I hate this... I hate...
[/page]Myself...",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"...[/page]But is there truly nothing you can do?"
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	"What?",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"You remind her about the device that she talked about on Tuesday in lab."
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	"That was... a rumor. Guy even joked about it. No one has ever actually made one.",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	@"But if anyone could, you would be the one to do it.
[/page]Think about it. This is something you can do now.
[/page]You could have done something before, but you can make up for it now with this.
[/page]Everyone will like you. The real you."
);

obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Yeah.[/page]Yeah![sewing_club_ashley]I can do this! I can help everyone!
[/page]Talk to me tomorrow after club, Senpai. We can work together, we can do this!
[/page][rainbow]This is going to be super, duper, sugoi![/rainbow]",
	"Ashley", spr_ashley_portrait_default, sfx_noisy_speech
);

obj_scribble.textbox_unnamed(
	"[npc_move,obj_ashley,1,1,215,35][npc_teleport,obj_ashley,school_1F,1000,1000,3]...Good, this will work perfectly."
);
